From: SunnyVishnu3 <krishnasgnik3@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 02:34:27 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 113/140] feat(player): add post-processing shader presets and
 update hdr-toys shaders

- Add 22 GLSL post-processing shaders and 14 preset chains (including Eden .fxp ports)

- Implement PostProcessingSheet with preset chips, descriptions, and collapsible sliders

- Add POST_PROCESSING player button with custom lens aperture and sparkle icon

- Integrate hot debounced shader compilation and MPV glsl-shaders chaining

- Add persistent preferences and lifecycle hooks across playback and PiP

- Update HDR-Toys tone mapping and transfer function shaders
